1
00:01:31,675 --> 00:01:35,558
You are not kind!
You are mean!

2
00:01:35,791 --> 00:01:39,597
I'm just trying to help you!

3
00:01:43,111 --> 00:01:45,307
You must be able to withstand some criticism!

4
00:01:45,307 --> 00:01:49,448
How should you be better if you can't hear what you do wrong?

5
00:01:49,544 --> 00:01:54,091
Haven't you heard of two stars and a desire?

6
00:01:54,213 --> 00:01:56,537
What did you say for something?

7
00:01:56,538 --> 00:02:00,000
Two stars and one wish.

8
00:02:00,174 --> 00:02:01,047
What is it?

9
00:02:01,124 --> 00:02:09,607
You tell two positive things and one thing you can get better at.
